00:10:51.347 --> 00:10:53.268
<v Host>Every opposition party.

00:10:53.868 --> 00:11:00.515
<v Slow>法案は、来週から、どこで話し合われますか。

00:11:01.316 --> 00:11:04.460
<v Host>In the House of Councillors, the upper house.

00:11:05.059 --> 00:11:11.875
<v Host>That's all for this evening. The next step is the upper house. Thanks for listening, and see you next time.

00:11:12.475 --> 00:11:14.875
